# Line endings are not cosmetic here.
#
# This machine has core.autocrlf=true, so without this file a `git clone` or
# `git checkout` on Windows rewrites text files with CRLF. scripts/backup.sh is
# bind-mounted straight into a Linux container, where a trailing \r turns
# `set -eu` into an illegal option and the backup silently fails into a logfile
# nobody reads. Everything we ship runs on Linux; the repo is LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must be LF, no exceptions — they execute inside containers.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Don't let git touch these at all.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
